// Repro: `cycle to next` with no eligible next player must surface as a
// recoverable error, not a panic (fixed 2026-08, D-1 / I-13 — resolve_turn
// never considers the current player, so with both players out there is no
// next player).
player P1, P2
turnorder (P:P1, P:P2)

stage Play for current 1 times {
  set P:P1 out of game
  set P:P2 out of game
  cycle to next
}
